;
; Kindred's name index in MYRA (kindred_rules.h KR6): the contacts by name
; code, then number, with when the entry was made (ms since 1970). A
; name-prefix search walks it in order ($ORDER) from the prefix's code up
; to the prefix's code plus 100 ** (9 - len), the range name_prefix_hit
; tests one name against.
^ZXKINDREDNAME(name:i18, contact:i6) = stamp:i13!
